Thirty packages stacked: OLD 108 (105 replaced; .vscode/tasks.json and acatchtray.cpp kept machine), NEW 35, both-changed 22
(16 merged, 6 designer / WORKLOG kept machine by rule), SAME 88. Every OLD file scanned for machine-only AI(W906-*) tags and W906_
identifiers: WebBridgeServer.cpp (TOKEN-OFF / SOFTKEY panel.estop) merged instead -- machine lines + the laptop's pad.get / pad.close /
act.observerSG.state exemptions; acatchtray.cpp kept (laptop = machine minus PROBECYL9050); Main.MotionView9050.html replaced (machine
== base). Conflicts: cinitial (BOOTCLEAR9050 + MainProc pitch-sync comment), test_flow9050_tray ([BC] / [PC]), csystem (pitch sync
stays in MainProc) -> machine; test_scankey_golden ([18] / [19]), IoBtnPanelClick (W906_IoPadClick_St02), tests/CMakeLists (2 blocks),
WebBridgeTags (tester.name, Jerry 1008 ruling A = golden LoadTestModePicture) -> laptop; wb_serve line 239 -> machine IOWAIT + the
laptop's g_ppCyc0 / g_ppTsc0 move. EastSun's uncommitted acatchtray / asendic_Loader / cinitial / PadInterface_St02 (SafeLock) edits
were set aside and merged back on top, not committed. Package 203: 15 files (9 replaced, 4 new, 2 merged, no conflicts); 204: 12 files (9 replaced, 1 new, 2 merged, no conflicts).
After the merge: test_scankey_golden gets its PadInterface_St02.h include back; its [19] (the laptop's ST02-P2 soft keys) is off here
(this machine keeps its own SOFTKEY design). WORKLOG: the 173-204 row, row 213 (SAYTHROTTLE 9a815eb), section 3 rows tools 0174-0178.
ctest Debug 426/441 -- the 15 failures are all WORKLOG row 381's known list (environment / laptop settings / machine patches);
after 204 the 29 related tests pass. Backup branch backup/pre-pkg202-20261008; files D:\HT9045\_pkg_20[234]\backup_machine_*.

