+//                                           W906IniDataRedirect, common.cpp:226; <recipe> = GetLastOpenFN()), or
+//                                           DefaultPath\DefineOffset when CUSTOMER_CODE==CC_ASE_CL || IniConfig.bE45_AllSetupFileUseOneFile,
+//                                           or the "[group]" folder when IniConfig.bE59GroupOffsetFile (GetOffsetPath above).
